  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Corpse City’s treasury, cold moon divine bravery is the most precious immortal material: a rank seven immortal material condensed from moonlight at the center of the desert, taking ten thousand years to form. Inside treasure yellow heaven it is priceless. The quantity is so small that even rank eight Gu Immortals do not have much. The same treasury holds the greatest quantity of phosphorescent wood, a rank six immortal material that grows in fierce ghost desert. Fang Yuan finds both among the Western Desert Zombie Alliance branch stock after taking that inheritance.",
